# Title: Potential Discovery Activity Using Find - Linux
# ID: 8344c0e5-5783-47cc-9cf9-a0f7fd03e6cf
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-12-28
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1083
# Description: Detects usage of "find" binary in a suspicious manner to perform discovery
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(Image="*/find" AND (CommandLine CONTAIN "-perm -4000" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-perm -2000" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-perm 0777" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-perm -222" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-perm -o w" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-perm -o x" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-perm -u=s" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "-perm -g=s"))
